A fence in an item in a description keeps its trailing blank

````
:: t
: . ```
     ```

.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <pre><code> ```

</code></pre>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </dd>
</dl>
````

